 out online application through school webpage</u> and send me <u>one\noriginal application document through post</u> and <u>one scanned application\ndocument (except the letter of recommendation) through E-mail</u> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans-Bold;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-weight:\nbold\">no later than <u>June 21<sup>st</sup> (Fri), 2024</u></span><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">.<o:p></o:p></span></u></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\">*Online application is\navailable only during application period, which is from May 7th(10am) till June\n21st(5pm), 2024.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:italic\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;\ntext-align:left;line-height:normal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;word-break:keep-all\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:13.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\nmso-fareast-font-family:DejaVuSans;color:black;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-bidi-font-style:\nitalic\">All required documents must be written either in English or Korean by\ncomputer typing.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"l